        <h3 style="color: #f8fafc; font-size: 1.1rem; font-weight: 700; margin-bottom: 8px;">What documents are required to book packers and movers in Hiranandani for a local shift?</h3>
        <p style="color: #cbd5e1; line-height: 1.7; font-size: 0.95rem; margin: 0;">Clients need a valid government ID, proof of residence (utility bill or rental agreement), a detailed inventory list, and the GST registration number if the move is corporate. Providing these upfront speeds up the instant estimate and ensures compliance with IBA regulations.</p>
      </div>
      <div style="margin-bottom: 14px; background: rgba(255,255,255,0.03); border: 1px solid rgba(255,255,255,0.08); border-radius: 8px; padding: 16px 20px;">
        <h3 style="color: #f8fafc; font-size: 1.1rem; font-weight: 700; margin-bottom: 8px;">How does the 100% insurance policy protect my belongings during a Hiranandani to hub relocation?</h3>
        <p style="color: #cbd5e1; line-height: 1.7; font-size: 0.95rem; margin: 0;">Our insurance covers the full declared value of each item, backed by an IRDAI‑approved marine transit policy. In the unlikely event of loss or damage, claims are processed within 10 business days, and reimbursement is paid directly to the customer without any hidden deductions.</p>
      </div>
      <div style="margin-bottom: 14px; background: rgba(255,255,255,0.03); border: 1px solid rgba(255,255,255,0.08); border-radius: 8px; padding: 16px 20px;">
        <h3 style="color: #f8fafc; font-size: 1.1rem; font-weight: 700; margin-bottom: 8px;">Are the packing charges for household goods in Hiranandani fixed or variable?</h3>
        <p style="color: #cbd5e1; line-height: 1.7; font-size: 0.95rem; margin: 0;">Packing charges are calculated based on volume, item fragility, and the selected 7‑layer protection level. While base rates are transparent, additional services such as custom crates or climate‑controlled packing may adjust the final cost, all of which are clearly itemised in the cost matrix.</p>
      </div>
      <div style="margin-bottom: 14px; background: rgba(255,255,255,0.03); border: 1px solid rgba(255,255,255,0.08); border-radius: 8px; padding: 16px 20px;">
        <h3 style="color: #f8fafc; font-size: 1.1rem; font-weight: 700; margin-bottom: 8px;">What advantages does an IBA‑approved mover provide over non‑approved service providers in Hiranandani?</h3>
        <p style="color: #cbd5e1; line-height: 1.7; font-size: 0.95rem; margin: 0;">IBA approval guarantees adherence to a standardized code of conduct, mandatory insurance, and regular audits. This ensures higher safety standards, reliable documentation for reimbursement claims, and a trusted grievance redressal mechanism, giving Hiranandani residents peace of mind.</p>
      </div>
      <div style="margin-bottom: 14px; background: rgba(255,255,255,0.03); border: 1px solid rgba(255,255,255,0.08); border-radius: 8px; padding: 16px 20px;">
        <h3 style="color: #f8fafc; font-size: 1.1rem; font-weight: 700; margin-bottom: 8px;">How is GST applied to moving services for a Hiranandani household shift?</h3>
        <p style="color: #cbd5e1; line-height: 1.7; font-size: 0.95rem; margin: 0;">GST is levied at the prevailing rate of 18% on the total service invoice, which includes packing, transportation, and insurance. The invoice clearly shows the GST amount, and the rate complies with the latest GST council notifications for movers and packers.</p>
      </div>
      <div style="margin-bottom: 14px; background: rgba(255,255,255,0.03); border: 1px solid rgba(255,255,255,0.08); border-radius: 8px; padding: 16px 20px;">
        <h3 style="color: #f8fafc; font-size: 1.1rem; font-weight: 700; margin-bottom: 8px;">Can I track my shipment in real time while it travels from Hiranandani to the destination hub?</h3>
        <p style="color: #cbd5e1; line-height: 1.7; font-size: 0.95rem; margin: 0;">Yes, every truck is equipped with satellite GPS that feeds live location updates to our client portal. Customers receive a secure link to monitor progress, view checkpoint timestamps, and receive alerts for any delays along the national highway corridor.</p>
      </div>
      <div style="margin-bottom: 14px; background: rgba(255,255,255,0.03); border: 1px solid rgba(255,255,255,0.08); border-radius: 8px; padding: 16px 20px;">
        <h3 style="color: #f8fafc; font-size: 1.1rem; font-weight: 700; margin-bottom: 8px;">What steps are taken at highway checkposts to ensure the safety of my goods during the Hiranandani transit?</h3>
        <p style="color: #cbd5e1; line-height: 1.7; font-size: 0.95rem; margin: 0;">At each checkpost, our drivers present the e‑Way bill, insurance certificate, and cargo manifest. Trained security personnel verify seal integrity, and any discrepancies are immediately reported. This systematic protocol minimizes risk and aligns with the route logistics advisory for Hiranandani moves.</p>
      </div>
  </div>
